    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466320/extras/96cb06e95435e0fc9ac2e3404df19c95.poster.avif?t=1740124639\" width=800 height=2162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466320/extras/96cb06e95435e0fc9ac2e3404df19c95.webm?t=1740124639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466320/extras/96cb06e95435e0fc9ac2e3404df19c95.mp4?t=1740124639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Vinyl Drop</strong>, the ultimate game for music lovers and collectors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>What\u2019s the game?</strong><br>Tap, collect, and trade virtual vinyl records. Spin your way through a world of rare finds, legendary albums, and a community that lives for the groove!<br><br>\ud83d\uded2 <strong>How to Play:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Vinyls</strong> \u2013 Open random drops every few hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Use the Steam Marketplace to trade with other players. Build your dream collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Rarity</strong> \u2013 Every drop is a chance at <strong>Common, Rare, or Legendary</strong> vinyls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show Your Style</strong> \u2013 Use your collection to unlock themed levels inspired by your records.<br><br><strong>Rarity Chances:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Common</strong> \u2013 72%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Uncommon</strong> \u2013 20% <br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Rare</strong> \u2013 7% <br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Epic</strong> \u2013 0.9% <br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Legendary</strong> \u2013 0.1%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the one to score the ultimate Legendary vinyl?<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa7 Inventory Drops</strong> \u2013 Open random vinyls every 2 hours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbf Marketplace Trading</strong> \u2013 Trade with others to complete your set (Steam only).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Community Designs</strong> \u2013 Submit vinyl designs via Discord. Your art could be the next drop!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 Themed Levels</strong> \u2013 Unlock and play levels inspired by the vinyls you collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfba <strong>Submit your music</strong> - Send your own music via Discord, and we'll make your vinyls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Do you have what it takes to become the ultimate Vinyl God?</strong> Start building your collection today!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466320/extras/96cb06e95435e0fc9ac2e3404df19c95.poster.avif?t=1740124639\" width=800 height=2162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466320/extras/96cb06e95435e0fc9ac2e3404df19c95.webm?t=1740124639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466320/extras/96cb06e95435e0fc9ac2e3404df19c95.mp4?t=1740124639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Vinyl Drop</strong>, the ultimate game for music lovers and collectors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>What\u2019s the game?</strong><br>Tap, collect, and trade virtual vinyl records. Spin your way through a world of rare finds, legendary albums, and a community that lives for the groove!<br><br>\ud83d\uded2 <strong>How to Play:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Vinyls</strong> \u2013 Open random drops every few hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Use the Steam Marketplace to trade with other players. Build your dream collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Rarity</strong> \u2013 Every drop is a chance at <strong>Common, Rare, or Legendary</strong> vinyls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show Your Style</strong> \u2013 Use your collection to unlock themed levels inspired by your records.<br><br><strong>Rarity Chances:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Common</strong> \u2013 72%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Uncommon</strong> \u2013 20% <br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Rare</strong> \u2013 7% <br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Epic</strong> \u2013 0.9% <br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Legendary</strong> \u2013 0.1%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the one to score the ultimate Legendary vinyl?<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa7 Inventory Drops</strong> \u2013 Open random vinyls every 2 hours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbf Marketplace Trading</strong> \u2013 Trade with others to complete your set (Steam only).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Community Designs</strong> \u2013 Submit vinyl designs via Discord. Your art could be the next drop!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 Themed Levels</strong> \u2013 Unlock and play levels inspired by the vinyls you collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfba <strong>Submit your music</strong> - Send your own music via Discord, and we'll make your vinyls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Do you have what it takes to become the ultimate Vinyl God?</strong> Start building your collection today!</p></li></ul>",
